<HTML>
<P>The "Setup" item is intended to be run once, before installation/upgrade.
It creates or updates the preferences file using defaults for new properties.
Obsolete and existing properties are not changed, even if the old property
setting might not be valid.

<P>You may "drag-n-drop" the program icon to your desktop or dock.

<P>You may also drag-n-drop the "Wang600Files" folder to your home directory,
or other location, to get the sample programs. This folder is also used
to store any programs you create. If another location is desired,
the simulator "home" may be changed through the "Edit/Preferences"
menu on the calculator.

<P>The Uninstall item in this package may be used to uninstall this program,
or you can simply move the program icon, from desktop or dock, to the trash.
</HTML>
